        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cover of woven silk and cotton. Woven with a silk warp and a cotton weft. Striped with broad yellow satin  stripes and groups of narrower stripes in red, white, blue, white, green, white. There is a border of yellow stripe and the group of narrow stripes is repeated. The panel is backed with a plain linen cloth and is edged with gilt braid. Satin of 8."@en , "Cover of woven silk and cotton, made in Europe, 18th century."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/ae7a3782-761d-3847-ba2f-ae4e4f6ced67> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Cover of woven silk and cotton. Woven with a silk warp and a cotton weft. Striped with broad yellow satin  stripes and groups of narrower stripes in red, white, blue, white, green, white. There is a border of yellow stripe and the group of narrow stripes is repeated. The panel is backed with a plain linen cloth and is edged with gilt braid. Satin of 8."@en , "Cover of woven silk and cotton, made in Europe, 18th century."@en ;
